docs: Say that a truncated export resets rather than ends cleanly

The same two places #1830 corrects, carried here so this branch's own diff does
not describe the old behaviour: a walk that dies part-way resets the connection,
so a client reads an error and `agentop export` exits non-zero, rather than
ending the body cleanly and looking complete.

Identical text to #1830's, so merging that into this branch changes nothing.

